stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NoRow : first message

    NoRow --> AwaitingRepo : no org default repo\nsave partial conversation
    NoRow --> FreshPreparing : default repo exists

    AwaitingRepo --> AwaitingRepo : owner/name parse failed\nsave bot nudge
    AwaitingRepo --> FreshPreparing : owner/name parsed\nuse original History[0]

    FreshPreparing --> RepoResolveFailed : GitHub App cannot access repo
    RepoResolveFailed --> AwaitingRepo : repo fields cleared\nnext message picks repo

    FreshPreparing --> SandboxCreating : repo resolved\ntoken minted\nbranch chosen
    SandboxCreating --> RetryReady : sandbox create failed\nrepo kept, no sandbox_id
    RetryReady --> FreshPreparing : next message retries\nsame repo as new request

    SandboxCreating --> FreshAgentRunning : sandbox_id saved
    FreshAgentRunning --> FailedWithSandbox : setup/agent timeout,\nagent error, or PR not verified
    FailedWithSandbox --> FreshPreparing : next message archives\norphan sandbox first

    FreshAgentRunning --> PRReady : PR verified\nconversation saved\nsandbox archived

    PRReady --> FollowUpRunning : user sends follow-up\nsame thread/session
    FollowUpRunning --> PRReady : follow-up PR verified\nnew turn saved\nsandbox archived
    FollowUpRunning --> FollowUpFailed : resume, agent, or PR validation failed
    FollowUpFailed --> FollowUpRunning : next message continues\nsame PR conversation

    FreshPreparing --> Cancelled : stop before/while creating sandbox
    FreshAgentRunning --> Cancelled : fresh run cancelled\nsandbox archived
    FollowUpRunning --> Cancelled : follow-up cancelled\nsandbox left available

    PRReady --> [*] : abandoned
    Cancelled --> [*]

    note right of AwaitingRepo
        Stored conversation:
        History[0] = original request
        GitHubOwner/GitHubRepo = ""
        SandboxID = ""
        PRURL = ""
        AgentSlug, Model, TaskOptions are saved
    end note

    note right of FailedWithSandbox
        Fresh-run failure:
        SandboxID is saved and PRURL is empty.
        The sandbox is left for debugging until
        the next message archives it and starts over.
    end note

    note right of PRReady
        Successful conversation:
        SandboxID, Branch, PRURL are set.
        The Daytona sandbox is archived, not destroyed,
        so follow-ups resume the same filesystem.
    end note

    note left of FreshAgentRunning
        Each turn also has an agent_runs row:
        preparing -> running -> finalizing ->
        succeeded / failed / cancelled.
        recoverable interruptions move through recovering.
    end note
